### 1. Provider mặc định (mock)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/mail/send
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "a@test.com", "subject": "Hello", "content": "<h1>Hi</h1>" }

### 2. SMTP (cần điền SMTP_USER/SMTP_PASS trong .env)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/mail/send
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "a@test.com", "subject": "Hello", "content": "Test SMTP", "provider": "smtp" }

### 3. Lỗi validation
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/mail/send
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "invalid-email-format", "subject": "" }

### 4. Provider không hợp lệ
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/mail/send
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "a@test.com", "subject": "x", "content": "y", "provider": "sendgrid" }